{"unit_id":"knottttt__codex-dsh-bridge#card-zh","repo":"knottttt/codex-dsh-bridge","commit":"3168b8611b8d02f66b4305ea447c20b545f0167d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"codex-dsh-bridge-companion 是 DeepSeek Harness Web 插件，在 Harness 的插件设置中加入 Codex DSH Bridge 配置卡片。用户可以启用或停用 Codex 桥接，并设置本机 Harness 地址；设置通过 Harness 设置接口读取和保存，修改后会镜像到本机共享配置文件。界面提供中英文文案、地址格式提示、保存与放弃修改操作，并在设置版本冲突时载入最新值供用户重新确认。适合需要从 Harness 管理本机 Codex 桥接开关和地址的用户。使用前需安装到 Harness web profile，不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh-plugin/lib/client.js:61-104","dsh-plugin/lib/client.js:120-241","dsh-plugin/lib/index.js:24-59","dsh-plugin/lib/config.js:48-64"]}
{"unit_id":"knottttt__codex-dsh-bridge#card-en","repo":"knottttt/codex-dsh-bridge","commit":"3168b8611b8d02f66b4305ea447c20b545f0167d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"codex-dsh-bridge-companion adds a bilingual settings card to DeepSeek Harness Web. Users can toggle the local Codex bridge and change its Harness endpoint. Settings are saved and mirrored to a local config file. The card supports save, discard, and reloading after revision conflicts.","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh-plugin/lib/client.js:61-104","dsh-plugin/lib/client.js:120-241","dsh-plugin/lib/index.js:24-59","dsh-plugin/lib/config.js:48-64"]}
